# Always deploy when done

After finishing a user-requested change to this dashboard (UI, pages, HA packages, or related scripts), run `npm run deploy` from the project root before considering the task complete.

- Use `required_permissions: ["all"]` so Samba (`\\homeassistant.local\config`) is reachable.
- Do not wait for the user to ask to deploy.
- Skip deploy only if the work was purely Q&A, a failed/incomplete change, or the user explicitly said not to deploy.
- After a successful deploy, mention that it is live (and the local dashboard URL if useful).
